{"unit_id": "tag:06HV:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们可以利用纤维范畴（fibre categories）来部分解释条件 (S1) 和 (S2) 的含义。假设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>中的环映射（ring maps），且<MATH_0004>是满射的（surjective）。用<MATH_0005>表示投影（projection）映射（maps）。假设已经选定<MATH_0006>的推前（pushforwards）。于是环（rings）的交换图（commutative diagram）转化为<MATH_0007>-交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0008>，这是纤维范畴（fibre categories）的图，从而得到函子（functor）<MATH_0009>，映入范畴（categories）的<MATH_0010>-纤维积（fibre product）。条件 (S1) 要求此函子（functor）是本质满射的（essentially surjective）。条件 (S2) 的第一部分要求此函子（functor）是本质满射的（essentially surjective），如果<MATH_0011>等于映射（map）<MATH_0012>。此外，此时 (S2) 的第二部分蕴涵：在目标中变得同构的（isomorphic）两个对象（objects），在来源中也是同构的（isomorphic）（但它<TEXTITOPEN_0001>不<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>等价（equivalent）于此陈述）。如定义中那样表述这些条件的优点是无须作出任何选择。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["S"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "fibre categories", "target_term": "纤维范畴"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "pushforwards", "target_term": "推前"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "fibre categories", "target_term": "纤维范畴"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "essentially surjective", "target_term": "本质满射的"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "essentially surjective", "target_term": "本质满射的"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构的"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构的"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_ter