{"unit_id": "tag:06HZ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的群胚上余纤维化的范畴（category cofibred in groupoids）。若<MATH_0003>满足 (S2)，则在将<MATH_0004>替换为<MATH_0005>时，(S2) 的条件仍成立，这适用于任意有限维（finite dimensional）<MATH_0006>-向量空间（vector space）<MATH_0007>。\n", "allowed_english": ["S"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category cofibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚上余纤维化的范畴"}, {"source_term": "finite dimensional", "target_term": "有限维"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "category cofibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚上余纤维化的范畴", "context": "所给范畴，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "finite dimensional", "target_term": "有限维", "context": "向量空间维数性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "所给向量空间，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
